{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29888","headline":"细雨成咏献尚书河东公 · 李商隐","name":"细雨成咏献尚书河东公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洒砌听来响，卷帘看已迷。\n江间风暂定，云外日应西。\n稍稍落蝶粉，班班融燕泥。\n颭萍初过沼，重柳更缘堤。\n必拟和残漏，宁无晦暝鼙。\n半将花漠漠，全共草萋萋。\n猿别方长啸，鸟惊始独栖。\n府公能八咏，聊且续新题。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29888.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29888","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}